### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Create conversation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "默认会话"
}

### List conversations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/conversations

### Create knowledge base
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge-bases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "默认知识库"
}

### List knowledge bases
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge-bases

### Upload knowledge file
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge-bases/1/files
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="demo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

这是一个用于测试知识库入库的文档。
--WebAppBoundary--

### Get ingest task
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ingest/tasks/ingest-1

### List knowledge files
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge-bases/1/files

### Send chat message
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "你好，介绍一下 Lyle AI",
  "knowledgeBaseIds": ["1"]
}
